#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:12
#: 0ba1d070258f45b88acd6d799cd230cb 112a01aaa7b2490da5a1e7c337ac96a5
#: 8922e0a51a2e4a04b72f8bdd69c3ec3d 930989992c4c4a85a4ac206b87451591
#: aa9a3a6024ef4137bd454cac31ecc7d7
msgid ""
"Assuming you have setup the build and SITL environment, run SITL. See "
":ref:`using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing`. For example:"
msgstr ""
"假设你已搭建好编译和 SITL 环境，运行 SITL。参见 :ref:`using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing`。例如："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:21
#: 0383da28c574480fa2ec97ca4e6f49b2 706892d2ab404adbb109101aee192311
#: 7b66d5bd1eaf438cb555380a30f52341 b20b24227b1c442eb922a83dcdae177a
#: cf0cd87cd2a9430d99aab34cec41ba99
msgid ""
"From your GCS, enable scripting by setting the :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>`"
" parameter to \"1\". Restart the simulation by halting it with CTRL+C and "
"restarting sim_vehicle, or in MAVProxy, type ``reboot``."
msgstr ""
"在地面站中，将 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` 参数设为 \"1\" 以启用脚本。用 CTRL+C 停止仿真并重新运行 "
"sim_vehicle 来重启仿真，或在 MAVProxy 中输入 ``reboot``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:22
#: 219f3747d6b746a1bcdd75e4dc6adb58 253d278cdef340a4a2ccc31e66b5af57
#: 384456d4483a4cafb00a6ce72ffd81c9 4709c0da332042b8818af329e028f9ba
#: 5a424f6b898d4dcdbbdda0649518341f
msgid ""
"A \"scripts\" sub-directory will be created in the directory you started the"
" simulation, if it did not already exist. You should expect to see a line "
"similar to the following: ``Lua: State memory usage: 4824 + 9263``. This "
"shows that scripting is now enabled."
msgstr ""
"如果尚不存在，启动仿真的目录下会创建一个 \"scripts\" 子目录。你应能看到类似如下的一行：``Lua: State memory usage:"
" 4824 + 9263``。这表明脚本功能已启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:23
#: 295b1945c9d14713862bc791f550e07e 32b03dd9ccb9406392a49f55f64cbd73
#: a23ef871f01a45ab8948380e4cb4633b c725924f9a594b49a2f71ea4f5db77f9
#: d337bda5959a4cec9ca2634843f09122
msgid ""
"Now, create your first script in the ``scripts`` folder. If it's your first "
"time, try the hello world script"
msgstr "现在，在 ``scripts`` 文件夹中创建你的第一个脚本。如果是第一次，可以试试 hello world 脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:29
#: 47ff8eee72ec4c8aa16b69ed14a75489 8667de325546478f801f23d9da1e697d
#: 91207e411ac242fbb96caa6f3a28df22 c414138ba3f54a86b739168a7d527576
#: c609aed61c344286b4b1f2badfa08a2d
msgid "Again, restart the simulation."
msgstr "再次重启仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:30
#: 0c10159543874f33abbe0cf3bc2848d9 23f698a9b4064e77b91f15a9a561c50b
#: 37b48a3b241343beaf3f3d2867f24305 bd88ac8382fd41bc870f74fd48fed355
#: dd9618bb7d634137a741ecdac635c702
msgid "You should now observe the following in console."
msgstr "现在你应该能在控制台中看到以下内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:35
#: 56838713360e4b448ccfa744f82df707 6ca4ad92fcf54c4d98a988823684149d
#: 73b14aebfe214c59afa1eb8a0ae7e22e afb4edbc9a5e4eccbe748c9bb2e35a17
#: c18785adc5c3405a9e766f32dfa00ed0
msgid ""
"Now, you can try changing the script to say something else and saving the "
"Lua script."
msgstr "现在，你可以尝试把脚本改成输出其他内容，并保存该 Lua 脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:36
#: 23dc091cff1e476b86542877a050f574 32b8366d1dd94355a62a9ce1dbb78ba7
#: 57b933f933e94a62ba93d15dbaad5cbb 8861e27c24924afb85ff97cd67318b2b
#: c656046386164c63b148d4a527c2d10c
msgid ""
"In MAVProxy, once you you save changes to your Lua script, you can just "
"restart the scripting engine with ``scripting restart``. This allows to you "
"keep SITL running and quickly change your script."
msgstr ""
"在 MAVProxy 中，保存对 Lua 脚本的修改后，只需用 ``scripting restart`` 重启脚本引擎即可。这样可以保持 SITL "
"运行并快速修改脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:37
#: 05c4a9b24f924442a67988f51b42892d 286bf632216d4eff82186bb58a77d937
#: 6a6da48d51604966b81e7583e4626741 8a317856fafd4ad597c063f4891625bb
#: dc887a59a1c647e58252fdb81a36b403
msgid ""
"If you get a \"Scripting: out of memory\" GCS message then you will need to "
"increase :ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` parameter and try to restart "
"the simulation. The hello world script has enough memory."
msgstr ""
"如果收到 \"Scripting: out of memory\" 地面站消息，则需要增大 "
":ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` 参数并尝试重启仿真。hello world 脚本的内存是足够的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:49
#: 0a06db56b55644f0b8cc6dbf21603c4f 40d65b67451f41e9b400d0c3a2be070a
#: 61de73f98fb645d6a3bc73cdb1562626 d6fe8960ca10404092244ef5044bdde4
#: df9cfd914c3e44898860a875dfddf7b9
msgid ""
"Connect your GCS and navigate to its parameters screen (CONFIG->Full "
"Parameter List in Mission Planner, Vehicle Setup->Parameters in QGC) . "
"Enable :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` =1. Disconnect and reconnect the "
"autopilot."
msgstr ""
"连接地面站并进入其参数页面（Mission Planner 中为 CONFIG->Full Parameter List，QGC 中为 Vehicle "
"Setup->Parameters）。设置 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` =1。断开并重新连接飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:59
#: 07ea631a7a874267b10fca26d42a6779 6cad4a0be17f46039582eb4c650a2bf0
#: 932c114c3c2b4008aa581d1f6b493298 dfc8403dfdef4f4a83be9ecf9940a690
#: fe33dda91c0e4a06a17c56f2103c57e5
msgid ""
"You can stop or restart scripting operations from the RC transmitter (see "
":ref:`Auxiliary switches <common-auxiliary-functions>`) or via MAVLink "
"command (GCS)."
msgstr ""
"你可以从遥控器（参见 :ref:`辅助开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>`）或通过 MAVLink "
"命令（地面站）停止或重启脚本运行。"
